  "body": "## Release Notes\n\n### Added\n- Optional `ui.cell_width` and `ui.cell_height` overrides so you can pin custom terminal cell metrics when needed.\n### Fixed\n- Windows now falls back to sensible cell metrics, restoring correct inline media scaling when `crossterm` reports zero pixel dimensions.\n\n## Install reddix 0.2.9\n\n### Install prebuilt binaries via shell script\n\n```sh\ncurl --proto '=https' --tlsv1.2 -LsSf https://github.com/ck-zhang/reddix/releases/download/v0.2.9/reddix-installer.sh | sh\n```\n\n### Install prebuilt binaries via powershell script\n\n```sh\npowershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -c \"irm https://github.com/ck-zhang/reddix/releases/download/v0.2.9/reddix-installer.ps1 | iex\"\n```\n\n## Download reddix 0.2.9\n\n|  File  | Platform | Checksum |\n|--------|----------|----------|\n| [reddix-aarch64-apple-darwin.tar.xz](https://github.com/ck-zhang/reddix/releases/download/v0.2.9/reddix-aarch64-apple-darwin.tar.xz) | Apple Silicon macOS | [checksum](https://github.com/ck-zhang/reddix/releases/download/v0.2.9/reddix-aarch64-apple-darwin.tar.xz.sha256) |\n| [reddix-x86_64-apple-darwin.tar.xz](https://github.com/ck-zhang/reddix/releases/download/v0.2.9/reddix-x86_64-apple-darwin.tar.xz) | Intel macOS | [checksum](https://github.com/ck-zhang/reddix/releases/download/v0.2.9/reddix-x86_64-apple-darwin.tar.xz.sha256) |\n| [reddix-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.zip](https://github.com/ck-zhang/reddix/releases/download/v0.2.9/reddix-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.zip) | x64 Windows | [checksum](https://github.com/ck-zhang/reddix/releases/download/v0.2.9/reddix-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.zip.sha256) |\n| [reddix-aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz](https://github.com/ck-zhang/reddix/releases/download/v0.2.9/reddix-aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz) | ARM64 Linux | [checksum](https://github.com/ck-zhang/reddix/releases/download/v0.2.9/reddix-aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz.sha256) |\n| [reddix-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz](https://github.com/ck-zhang/reddix/releases/